@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:start the process;
:review received application;
:load case data;
:review case;
:check if there are any new findings;
:v1: check if there are any new findings ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:they should recalculate the refund.;
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:send letter of denial;
endif
repeat :check again if there are any new findings;
:v2: check again if there are any new findings ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:they should recalculate the refund.;
repeat while () is ([v2 = 'Yes']) not ([v2 = 'No'])
:send another letter of denial;
:write back case data;
:end process;
stop
@enduml